n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"554\">\r\n<p data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"554\">🔋 2.5Ah capaciteit voor langere werktijd</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"617\">\r\n<p data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"617\">🛠️ Compatibel met diverse Gardena accu-tuingereedschappen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"650\">\r\n<p data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"650\">🖤 Strakke zwarte uitvoering</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"695\">\r\n<p data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"695\">📦 Nieuw in originele, gesealde verpakking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"700\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"724\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"869\">Merk: <strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"742\">Gardena</strong><br data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"745\">Model: <strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"765\">PBA 18/45</strong><br data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"768\">Voltage: <strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"784\">18V</strong><br data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"787\">Capaciteit: <strong data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"808\">2.5Ah</strong><br data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"811\">Kleur: <strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"827\">Zwart</strong><br data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"830\">Toestand: <strong data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"869\">Nieuw – in originele seal</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"874\">\r\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"925\"><strong data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"925\"><em data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"923\">Incl. 3 maanden garantie op werking en accu</em></strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-354\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--sp